      "text" : "Save Location",
      "translation" : "設定儲存地點"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Rest",
      "translation" : "休息"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Finish the conversation",
      "translation" : "結束對話"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Clinic has been set as your save point. Be careful though~",
      "translation" : "診所已設為你的儲存地點。不過要小心哦~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Restore your mind and body at our clinic. It's filled with Eclage's clean energy.",
      "translation" : "在我們的診所恢復身心吧。這裡充滿了艾克拉珠純淨的能量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We charge 1 Splendide Coin normally, but we offer a special discount for travelers. Your total is 5,000 zeny. ",
      "translation" : "平時收費1枚斯普蘭迪硬幣，不過我們為旅行者提供特別優惠。總共只需5,000 Zeny。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pay with Splendide Coin",
      "translation" : "用斯普蘭迪硬幣支付"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Pay with Zeny",
      "translation" : "用 Zeny 支付"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Forget it",
      "translation" : "算了"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It seems like you don't have enough coins. Would you check your account again, please?",
      "translation" : "你的硬幣似乎不夠。請再確認一下賬戶，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Make yourself at home~",
      "translation" : "請隨意休息~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Looks like you don't have enough resources to proceed. Do you mind checking your account again?",
      "translation" : "你的資源似乎不足，無法繼續。能請你再確認一下賬戶嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Receptionist]",
      "translation" : "[接待員]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Receptionist",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Make yourself at home~",
      "translation" : "請隨意休息~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Injured Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[受傷的拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ooww...",
      "translation" : "嗚啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Where...am...I?",
      "translation" : "我...在...哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Doctor]",
      "translation" : "[醫生]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You're at a clinic. Don't worry.",
      "translation" : "你在診所裡。別擔心。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We stopped the bleeding and cast emergency spells.",
      "translation" : "我們已經止住出血，並施了緊急治療魔法。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You were bleeding a lot. That was close, you know.",
      "translation" : "你流了很多血。真是險些喪命。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Injured Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[受傷的拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What, no, I...I don't feel anything...what's going on?",
      "translation" : "什麼，不，我...我什麼都感覺不到...這是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Doctor]",
      "translation" : "[醫生]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Umm...the arrow damaged your wing pretty badly...",
      "translation" : "嗯...箭矢把你的翅膀傷得很嚴重..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Injured Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[受傷的拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...what do you mean?",
      "translation" : "...你這是什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Doctor]",
      "translation" : "[醫生]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well...I was going to tell you after you recover, but you should know. You can't decorate the Yai anymore. ",
      "translation" : "嗯...我本想等你康復後再告訴你，但你應該知道。你再也不能裝飾自己的羽翼了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In other words, you injured your wing. The arrow went through the most critical part in the wing.",
      "translation" : "也就是說，你的翅膀受傷了。箭穿過了翅膀上最關鍵的部位。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Injured Laphine]",
      "translation" : "[受傷的拉菲內]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Injured Laphine",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What? No way...please...doctor!! No!!",
      "translation" : "什麼？不可能...拜託...醫生！！不要！！"
    }
  ]
}